        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "cohorts"
        ],
        "note": "5 ROWS, AND THAT IS WHY THIS RUN IS HERE: gasoline, diesel, CNG, E85 and electricity for the passenger car. The default `sampleVehiclePopulation` has no (21, CNG) row at any model year, so the CNG candidate of the cohort grid finds no vehicle and the run emits the same four fuels as a gasoline-only one. The second factor of the cohort candidate grid, and the first in the tree with a member that yields no cohort.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
